csv:     155mm-m107-casualties.csv
source:  ../ordnance-1944.md
anchor:  # 155-MM N.E. SHELL, M107

# See 75mm-m48-casualties.invariant for the column definitions and for why the
# 58 ft-lb energy closure is the only admissible column-identity discriminator
# on these interleaved two-column scans.
#
# Note: the scan prints B at r=80 ft as "..0148" (stray leading dot);
# transcribed as 0.0148, which is what the B monotonicity requires.
row:        0.5 * (m_oz / 16 / 32.174) * v_fps**2 == 58 within 5%

monotonic:  r_ft increasing
monotonic:  N non-increasing
monotonic:  B non-increasing
monotonic:  m_oz non-decreasing
monotonic:  v_fps non-increasing
